WEBVTT

00:43:29.621 --> 00:43:33.913
with the idea that I would only go if I
were offered a full a full fellowship

00:43:33.913 --> 00:43:35.788
or scholarship and tuition remission

00:43:35.788 --> 00:43:40.038
and that it wouldn't put me further in
student loan debt Torch was published

00:43:40.038 --> 00:43:41.746
in 2006.

00:43:41.746 --> 00:43:46.704
At that time, you had two children under
the age of two, 18 months apart.

00:43:47.538 --> 00:43:52.871
You started writing Wild in 2008, 13
years after you completed the hike.

00:43:53.121 --> 00:43:55.704
Initially, you thought it would
be a collection of essays.

00:43:56.496 --> 00:43:58.621
Your second book, What? What Changed?

00:43:59.954 --> 00:44:01.829
Yeah, well, you know, the reason
